"P3738934728" "Jenkins has joined you"
// DetailString :
"P3624164379" "Jenkins has joined you on your mission to plant the bomb and knock out the radar coverage."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3584458878" "The Arachnos demolitions guys didn't do their job right, and the radar coverage around Brickstown here is still up. <br><br>Typical.<br><br>I sent my co-pilot, Jenkins, into one of the bunkers with a bomb to finish the job, but I haven't got word back from him. If you want to get out of here, you are gonna have to bite the bullet and help out.<br><br>I need you to go into that bunker, rescue Jenkins and get the bomb he has. Once you have that, find the spot to place it and make sure it gets planted. Take out any escaped cons, or security guards you see down there; they'll only screw things up for the rest of us. Once that bomb is set, get back here ASAP. Then we can head off to Mercy Island."
// AcceptString :
"P3448645834" "Click here to accept the mission"
// SendOffString :
"P1093954653" "I've marked the bunker on your map and compass. Left click on the door to enter. Find Jenkins, defeat any enemies, and click on the image of the bomb in order to place it. With all that done, click Exit Mission in your Nav Bar and get back to me.<br><br><img src=COV_NavWithExit.tga>"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P60604774" "Plant bomb; Defeat all guards"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2217702027" "You need to get to that bunker, rescue Jenkins, and plant the bomb if we are going to be leaving this area any time soon."

